&lt;p&gt;Design, build, and operate production-grade security services, features, and internal tools that protect Box and its customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineer end-to-end applications and backend services with a strong foundation in modern data stores, application frameworks, and scalable architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build systems and automation to detect, prevent, and mitigate security threats at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop &quot;paved road&quot; frameworks, libraries, and guardrails that make secure development seamless and standard for all Box engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build security automation and verification controls integrated directly into Box CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
